  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><code>聊天切換</code></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fchat-toggle%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@2/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chat-toggle\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@2/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"> </a> <a href=\"https://github.com/MayaqqDev/ChatToggle/\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@2/assets/cozy/available/github_64h.png\" alt=\"Github\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmayaqq\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3af862e4-2c3a-4ae5-9caf-cc9f80d19620.png\" alt=\"Bisect合作\"> </a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><code>資訊</code></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">你是否厭倦了在使用FTBTeams時，每次要和隊伍溝通都得輸入<code>/ftbteams msg &lt;訊息&gt;</code>？沒有嗎？總之我已經解決這個問題了！這個模組讓這個前綴可以切換，這樣你就不必每次想跟隊友打招呼時都要重新輸入！只需輸入<code>/chat toggle</code>來切換狀態，以及<code>/chat message &lt;查詢&gt;</code>來更改前綴。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Maximusbarcz/ChatToggle/master/showcase.gif\" alt=\"展示\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><code>社群</code></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">如有任何問題或需要支援，你可以點擊下方按鈕加入我的Discord！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/w7PpGax9Bq\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@2/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord伺服器\"> </a></p>",
